{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41534","headline":"景阳台怀古 · 陈贶","name":"景阳台怀古","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"景阳六朝地，运极自依依。\n一会皆同是，到头谁论非。\n酒浓沈远虑，花好失前机。\n见此尤宜戒，正当家国肥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈贶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41534.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41534","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}